title: Public Works
subtitle: Labour: employment, infrastructure or workers’ housing.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_public_works.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'public_works') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.public_works (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.7). Opening and closing
// the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser
// who opened the card. Options that need a system of a later stage are shown with their reason.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'public_works');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_public_works');
!}

= Public works

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Public works belong to Labour; the Treasury alone gives no access. Each programme is large: its preparation (1 T) now, its launch (1 T) in the card “Prepared Reforms”. Working programmes add public jobs, at most 8 units in the country.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @employment
- @infrastructure
- @housing
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@employment
title: Quick employment of the unemployed
subtitle: Costs the budget 2 units a month for three months, then 1; two employment units raise output and give public jobs (+0.15 percentage points of output a unit).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'public_works', 'employment').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_public_works_employment_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'public_works', 'employment');
!}
go-to: result

@infrastructure
title: Transport and infrastructure
subtitle: Costs the budget 2 units a month for four months, then 1; two employment units raise output more (+0.25 percentage points of output a unit).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'public_works', 'infrastructure').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_public_works_infrastructure_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'public_works', 'infrastructure');
!}
go-to: result

@housing
title: Workers’ housing
subtitle: Costs the budget 2 units a month for four months, then 1; relief for the recipients, no employment units.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'public_works', 'housing').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_public_works_housing_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'public_works', 'housing');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Public works

